Stormbringer is a Michael Moorcock creation.  Stormbringer appears to 
be a huge, black, rune-engraved two-handed sword.  What it really is 
is a bound demon.

In use, Strombringer glows black (yes, I know that's weird), howls and
sucks souls.

Since Stormbringer does have a mind of its own, sometimes the souls it
sucks aren't the ones the user had in mind.....

See any or all of Michael Moorcock's fine books "Elric of Melnibone", 
"The Sailor on the Seas of Fate", "The Weird of the White Wolf", "The 
Vanishing Tower/The Sleeping Sorceress" (I've seen both titles for the
same book), "The Bane of the Black Sword", "Stormbringer", "The Castle
of the Pearl" and "The Revenge of the Rose".  They're well worth 
reading anyway.

As long as I'm posting - how does one get Stormbringer? Should I just 
engrave that name on a two-handed sword and dunk it in the fountains 
until Arioch is amused?

